---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet"
	pubDate={new Date('August 08 2021')}
	heroImage="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
>
	<h2>About Me</h2>
	<p>
		I am Alex Papineau, a web developer and digital media specialist with a passion for retro aesthetics, photography, and robust single-page applications. My work spans across multiple disciplines, from capturing stunning visual narratives through photography to engineering performant user interfaces using modern web technologies like Astro and Tailwind.
	</p>

	<h2>Skills & Experience</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Web Development:</strong> Astro, React, Tailwind CSS, TypeScript</li>
		<li><strong>Media Production:</strong> Photography, Videography, Lighting</li>
		<li><strong>Audio Engineering:</strong> Adobe Audition (Expert at cleaning up audio tracks, mixing multi-channel sound, and producing crisp podcasts and voiceovers)</li>
		<li><strong>Design:</strong> Figma, Adobe Photoshop, Retro/Hacker Aesthetics</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Equipment</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Camera:</strong> Sony A7III (Primary workhorse for capturing high-resolution photos and 4K video. Equipped with versatile glass for various environmental conditions)</li>
		<li><strong>Audio:</strong> Zoom H4n Pro Recorder, Rode NTG4 Shotgun Mic</li>
		<li><strong>Computing:</strong> Custom-built rig with Windows OS and dual 4K monitors for an optimal development and editing workflow.</li>
	</ul>
</Layout>
